{"4544650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astro Hop", "steam_appid": 4544650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic 2D platformer set in a colorful and cute world. Your goal is simple: guide your character, overcome obstacles, avoid deadly traps, and reach the exit gate at the end of the level. Time your moves perfectly and survive without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Different Levels:</strong> Complete 30 challenging stages to succeed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Platforming Mechanics:</strong> Jump, dodge moving saws, and watch out for lava pits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and Clean Design:</strong> Minimalist, sweet, and colorful pixel/vector graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Gameplay:</strong> Short and fun gaming sessions with easy-to-learn controls.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic 2D platformer set in a colorful and cute world. Your goal is simple: guide your character, overcome obstacles, avoid deadly traps, and reach the exit gate at the end of the level. Time your moves perfectly and survive without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Different Levels:</strong> Complete 30 challenging stages to succeed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Platforming Mechanics:</strong> Jump, dodge moving saws, and watch out for lava pits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple and Clean Design:</strong> Minimalist, sweet, and colorful pixel/vector graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Gameplay:</strong> Short and fun gaming sessions with easy-to-learn controls.</p></li